<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107337" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρβῐος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βία</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of overwhelming strength</i> or <i>might,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡρακλῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					10(11).15
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαῖμον,</span> i. e. Apollo, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				3.37
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντων ὑπέρβιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Oxy.</u>
					408.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly in
			bad sense, <i>overweening, lawless, wanton,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷος κείνου θυμὸς ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.262
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ὕβριν ἔχοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.368
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἦτορ ἔχοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					119
				</span></i>
			: neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρβιον</span> as
				Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.379
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.92
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				95
			</span></i>: regul. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βίως</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1523
			</span></i>.</div>
